## 1. Tại sao HTML Pitch Deck?

| Tiêu chí | PDF/PPT | HTML Pitch Deck |
|----------|---------|-----------------|
| Interactivity | ❌ Static | ✅ Click, scroll, hover, drag |
| Real-time update | ❌ Re-export | ✅ Edit & refresh |
| Data visualization | ❌ Static charts | ✅ Animated SVG scores |
| Before/After demo | ❌ Side-by-side | ✅ Drag slider comparison |
| Responsive | ❌ Fixed ratio | ✅ Any device |
| Shareability | 📎 File attached | 🔗 URL link |
| Version control | ❌ Manual | ✅ Git-trackable |
| Branding control | ⚠️ Template-limited | ✅ Pixel-perfect CSS |
| **Zero dependencies** | N/A | ✅ Single HTML file, opens offline |

---

## 2. 4 Concept Architectures

### Concept ① Scroll-Driven Narrative (Recommended)

Toàn bộ audit = 1 long-scroll page, mỗi section trigger animation khi user scroll đến.

```
┌──────────────────────────────────┐
│ HERO: Project Name + Score       │ ← fade-in on load
├──────────────────────────────────┤
│ SCORE PER SCREEN                 │ ← SVG ring animation
│ ┌─────────┐ ┌─────────┐ ┌───┐  │
│ │ Ring 50% │ │ Ring 50% │ │80%│  │
│ └─────────┘ └─────────┘ └───┘  │
├──────────────────────────────────┤
│ FINDINGS (severity-grouped)      │ ← scroll-reveal cards
│ ├── Critical (red border-left)   │
│ ├── Major (orange border-left)   │
│ └── Minor (amber border-left)   │
│     └── <details> for DDL refs   │ ← progressive disclosure
├──────────────────────────────────┤
│ RECOMMENDATIONS / CTA            │
└──────────────────────────────────┘
```

**Tech stack**: CSS `IntersectionObserver`, SVG `stroke-dashoffset`, HTML `<details>`, scroll progress bar.

**Best for**: Executive presentation, client-facing deliverable, story-driven narrative.

### Concept ② Dashboard Report

Single-page dashboard — metrics, severity matrix, findings table — dense information at glance.

```
┌──────────────────────────────────┐
│ STAT GRID (4 cards)              │
│ [58% Score] [38 Check] [22✓] [16✗]│
├──────────────────────────────────┤
│ SEVERITY MATRIX                  │
│ [3 Critical] [6 Major] [4 Minor]│
├──────────────────────────────────┤
│ FINDINGS TABLE (sortable)        │
│ ID | Severity | Screen | Issue   │
└──────────────────────────────────┘
```

**Tech stack**: CSS Grid, table with hover highlight.

**Best for**: Technical team, product managers, data-heavy reviews.

### Concept ③ Card Explorer (Non-Linear)

Filterable card grid — user chọn xem theo severity hoặc screen — non-sequential.

```
┌──────────────────────────────────┐
│ FILTER BAR                       │
│ [All] [Critical] [Major] [Minor] │
│ [Form nhập] [Xác nhận] [Kết quả]│
├──────────────────────────────────┤
│ CARDS GRID (auto-fill)           │
│ ┌────────┐ ┌────────┐ ┌────────┐│
│ │UXP-001 │ │UXP-002 │ │UXP-003 ││
│ │Critical│ │Critical│ │Critical││
│ │  ...   │ │  ...   │ │  ...   ││
│ │[tags]  │ │[tags]  │ │[tags]  ││
│ └────────┘ └────────┘ └────────┘│
└──────────────────────────────────┘
```

**Tech stack**: JS filter + DOM render, CSS Grid `auto-fill`, animated entry.

**Best for**: Large audits with diverse stakeholders, self-paced exploration.

### Concept ④ Animated Score Cards

Focus vào scoring — animated radial/donut charts cho từng heuristic category.

```
┌──────────────────────────────────┐
│ BIG RING: 58/100 (animated)      │
│         ╭───╮                    │
│         │58 │ counter animation  │
│         ╰───╯                    │
├──────────────────────────────────┤
│ HEURISTIC GRID (6 rings)         │
│ [Flow 80%] [Error 30%] [Load 40%]│
│ [Touch 90%] [A11y 50%] [Con. 60%]│
└──────────────────────────────────┘
```

**Tech stack**: SVG donut `stroke-dashoffset`, `requestAnimationFrame` counter, IntersectionObserver trigger.

**Best for**: Periodic audit comparison, KPI dashboard, gamified reporting.

