## 3. Design System (Tokens)

### Color Tokens

```css
:root {
  /* Backgrounds — Dark OLED Theme */
  --bg-base: #0a0e1a;
  --bg-surface: #111827;
  --bg-card: #1a2235;
  --bg-card-hover: #1f2a40;

  /* Text */
  --text-primary: #f1f5f9;
  --text-secondary: #94a3b8;
  --text-muted: #64748b;

  /* Accents */
  --accent-gold: #f59e0b;      /* Trust, fintech */
  --accent-purple: #8b5cf6;    /* Tech, premium */
  --accent-blue: #3b82f6;      /* Info, links */

  /* Severity (UX Audit specific) */
  --severity-critical: #ef4444;    /* Red */
  --severity-major: #f97316;       /* Orange */
  --severity-minor: #eab308;       /* Amber */
  --severity-pass: #22c55e;        /* Green */
  --severity-unverifiable: #6b7280; /* Gray */
}
```

### Typography

```css
/* Fonts (Google Fonts) */
--font-sans: 'IBM Plex Sans', system-ui, sans-serif;    /* Body — financial, trustworthy */
--font-display: 'Playfair Display', serif;                /* Headings — editorial, premium */
--font-mono: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;                  /* Scores, IDs — data feel */

/* Scale */
Hero h1:    clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 3.8rem) / font-weight: 800
Section h2: 1.8rem / font-weight: 800
Card h4:    0.95rem / font-weight: 600
Body:       0.85rem / line-height: 1.6
Badge:      0.72rem / font-weight: 600 / uppercase
ID mono:    0.8rem / font-weight: 500
```

**Google Fonts import:**
```html
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&family=Playfair+Display:wght@700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
```

### Motion Guidelines

| Element | Duration | Easing | Trigger |
|---------|----------|--------|---------|
| Score rings | 1.5s | `cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1)` | IntersectionObserver |
| Counter animation | ~1.2s | `requestAnimationFrame` | Tab switch / scroll |
| Scroll-reveal sections | 0.7s | ease | IntersectionObserver (threshold: 0.12) |
| Card hover | 0.25s | `cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1)` | hover |
| Progress bar | 0.1s | linear | scroll event |
| **Reduced motion** | 0.01ms | — | `prefers-reduced-motion: reduce` |

