## 9. Working Prototype

### File Location

```
ux-audit-pitch-demos/index.html    ← Single-file, zero dependencies
```

### How to Run

```bash
# Option 1: Direct open
open index.html

# Option 2: Local server (for full font loading)
python3 -m http.server 8787
# → http://localhost:8787

# Option 3: Any static hosting
# Upload index.html to GitHub Pages, Netlify, Vercel, etc.
```

### What's Included

