|---------|-----|-------------|
| Scroll Narrative | ① | Hero + score rings + findings with `<details>` + scroll progress |
| Dashboard | ② | Stats grid + severity matrix + findings table |
| Card Explorer | ③ | 7 filter buttons + dynamic card grid + tag system |
| Score Cards | ④ | Big animated 58/100 ring + 6 heuristic category rings |

